    shifting violently when in close proximity to a being not YET added to its engorged
    genetic pool. \r\n \r\n \r \nThe specimen was found outside of the (RE)  (REDA)
    insides, which made capture possible thanks to (RE) (REDACTED) in (REDACTED)
    space (REDA). \r\nIts original form is unknown, and due to its need to (REDACTED)
    it was originally thought as harmless,  likely of a class (REDA)-(RE). \r\n\r
    \n \r\n               -/<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/- \n----------------------------------------------
    \r \n \r\n<link>A-15</link> possesses an instantaneous regenerative (RE)-system,
    in conjunction with its polymorphy, that allows to (REDACTED),  it is not simple
    (REDA), making it of the highest value for experimentation and processing as
    an all in one subject_\r \n\r \n \r\n               -/<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/-
    \n---------------------------------------------- \r\r \n<b>BEHAVIORAL PROFILE:</b>
